Wiring for the project:

DFPlayer:
RX -> 1K Resistor -> D2 Arduino Nano
TX -> D3 Arduino Nano
VCC -> 5V Arduino Nano
GND -> GND
SPK1 -> a speaker wire
SPK2 -> the other speaker wire

Power system:
TP4056 B+ -> 18650 +
TP4056 B- -> 18650 -
TP4056 OUT+ -> MT3608+
TP4056 OUT- -> MT3608-
MT3608+ -> Switch -> Arduino 5V
MT3608- -> Arduino GND
